                "message": "✨ Match Zotero attachment paths to the PDFs in zotero-backup and move them\n\nAdds sp-bibtex-zotero: a dry run with an Org table plan, an apply and a\nrestore for the Zotero file paths of a .bib file (C-; L b z l/a/r). The PDFs\nmove to the top of the literature folder through devonthink-move.py and the\nfile field is rewritten.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCGfFMGGDntzUxNQTU",
